          "correction": "Choose single-GPU mode whenever fewer than the configured nproc GPUs are visible, or set nproc_per_node to the detected visible device count (and preserve the selected CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES list)."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
EOF

